koj hais yog lawm

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Yog lawm

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Vim tias nws yog ib qho chaw paub tam sim no

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Xaiv lub sijhawm tshuaj ntsuam thiab xaiv koj lub rooj zaum

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Qhov no puas yog ib feem ntawm cov txheej txheem booking daim pib saib yeeb yaj kiab?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Kuv tuaj yeem nug

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Tiam sis yog tias nws yog ib qho chaw tsis paub,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Kev tshuaj xyuas txhua qhov kev siv kom ntxaws

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Koj yuav rov ua qhov txheej txheem refining ntau zaus.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Nyob ntawm qhov xwm txheej ntawm qhov project

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Koj tuaj yeem rov ua qhov txheej txheem no ntau zaus,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Koj siv sijhawm ntau npaum li cas los xav txog kom zoo zoo,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Txo qhov kev sim thiab qhov yuam kev thaum lub sijhawm tsim qauv thiab kev siv.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Raws li kev sib tham txog tam sim no

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Peb tau teeb tsa peb cov neeg siv khoom siv ua plaub pawg:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Tom ntej no yog tus thawj coj

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Tus thawj coj pom tau tias muaj tsib yam kev tswj hwm:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Tus kheej, kuv ceev faj txog kev siv lo lus "Tswj" hauv kev txhim kho.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Kev tswj hwm yog ib qho lus dav dhau

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Tsis meej tias koj ua dab tsi

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Nws kuj zoo ib yam li no thiab

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Nws tswj hwm li cas tiag?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Kuv tsis paub

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Los ntawm kev tham nrog cov kws tshaj lij hauv thaj chaw

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Txhua yam khoom tswj hwm tau nthuav dav mus rau ib qho kev siv tshwj xeeb.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Yog tias nws yog ib qhov project tiag tiag

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Tej zaum yuav muaj ntau yam kev siv dua li qhov no.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Nov kuv tau ua kom yooj yim rau kev piav qhia.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Qhov tseem ceeb uas yuav tsum nco ntsoov ntawm no yog tias thaum koj tsim lub sijhawm khiav,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Koj tuaj yeem pom tias daim pib kuj tau tsim

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Thiab thaum yuav daim pib lossis them rov qab cov nyiaj

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Koj tuaj yeem pom tias peb siv cov kev pabcuam sab nraud hu ua lub rooj vag them nyiaj.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Kuv tau muab cov ntaub ntawv siv ntawm cov neeg siv khoom thiab cov thawj coj ua ke.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Xav txog tag nrho cov kev siv ntawm no

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Muaj ib yam dab tsi uas zoo li khoob

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Muaj kev xaiv ntxiv ib lub tsev ua yeeb yam

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Kuv tsis pom dab tsi zoo li Search Theatre

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Zoo li muaj ntau qhov xwm txheej siv uas raug tshem tawm.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Vim tias los ntawm qhov kev xav ntawm tus kws tshaj lij hauv thaj chaw, muaj ntau yam los piav qhia.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Cov ntaub ntawv siv no, uas zoo li pom tseeb heev,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Koj tuaj yeem tshem tawm cov lus piav qhia

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Yog li cas los ntawm qhov kev xav ntawm tus tsim tawm?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Zoo dua yog tsis txhob tham txog tej xov xwm yooj yim xws li nrhiav chaw ua yeeb yam.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Qhov no puas yuav pab tau ntau dua rau kev tswj cov ntaub ntawv?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Yog tias nws yog qhov tsim backend

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Cov xwm txheej siv yooj yim xws li kev tshawb nrhiav chaw ua yeeb yam

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Kuv xav tias tsis ua li cas yog tias koj hla nws mus

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Qhov kuv hais yog tias nws tsis lig dhau los teb thaum lub sijhawm ua tiav.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Tab sis yog tias nws yog ib qhov project tiag tiag

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Rau cov neeg npaj cov ntxaij vab tshaus, cov rooj plaub siv no yog qhov pib zoo.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Tus neeg npaj tau saib qhov kev siv ntawm kev nrhiav chaw ua yeeb yam.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Kuv yuav tsum ua li cas thiaj nrhiav tau cov chaw ua yeeb yam?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Koj yuav tau xav txog

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Thaum koj muab cov duab kos ua ke ua ib qho, nws zoo li nyuaj heev.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Yog tias nws yog ib qhov project tiag tiag, nws yuav nyuaj dua.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Hauv qhov no, tsis tas yuav tsum yuam kom muaj kev sib koom ua ke.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Kuv nyuam qhuav muab lawv sib sau ua ke ntawm no kom qhia tau tias muaj cov ntaub ntawv uas ploj lawm.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Kuv tau sau tag nrho cov ntaub ntawv uas ploj lawm

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Kuv muaj ib qho piv txwv siv uas qhov kev sib txuas rau tus neeg ua yeeb yam raug tshem tawm.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Qhov no siv rau ob qho tib si cov neeg siv khoom thiab cov thawj coj.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Thiab rau qhov yooj yim ntawm kev siv, kuv tau sau nws ua lus Askiv.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Nws tsis ua li cas tam sim no vim nws yog ib qho project me me

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Yog tias qhov project loj thiab nyuaj heev

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Tus kws tshaj lij hauv thaj chaw yuav tsum pib piav qhia qhov twg?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Tej zaum yuav nyuaj

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Tus thawj coj ua dab tsi?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Nws yog ib txoj haujlwm ntau heev

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Raws li xav tau los ntawm tus thawj coj

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Hauv qhov no, peb puas tuaj yeem faib cov neeg ua yeeb yam?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Nws tseem yog ib lub tswv yim zoo los tshuaj xyuas

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Thaum xub thawj kuv raug hu ua tus thawj coj

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Tej zaum yuav muaj peev xwm faib ua pawg raws li lub luag haujlwm

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Thiab siv lub Movie Booking System

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Tej zaum yuav muaj cov kev pabcuam sab nraud

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Yog peb faib cov neeg ua yeeb yam zoo li no,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Cov kws tshaj lij hauv thaj chaw yuav muaj peev xwm muab cov ntaub ntawv ntau dua.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Tau kawg, qhov no tsuas yog ib qho piv txwv ntawm kev tshuaj xyuas ib qho chaw nyuaj.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Tej zaum yuav muaj lwm txoj kev zoo

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Nws yog ib qho tseem ceeb uas yuav tsum teb tau yooj ywm nyob ntawm qhov xwm txheej.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Qhov no yog qhov xaus lus

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Lub sijhawm no, peb yuav siv daim duab qhia txog kev siv

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Teem cov hom phiaj rau qhov project

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Kuv tau dhau los ntawm theem pib ntawm kev tshuaj xyuas.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Tus kheej, thaum lub sijhawm tag nrho txoj kev loj hlob

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Kuv xav tias kev tshuaj xyuas yog qhov nyuaj tshaj plaws

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Vim tias peb yuav tsum npaj cov tswv yim tsis meej thiab tsis meej tshaj plaws.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Lub sijhawm tom ntej peb yuav los saib cov ntaub ntawv siv tseem ceeb

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Cia peb tshuaj xyuas nws kom meej ntxiv

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Ua tsaug rau koj txoj kev ua haujlwm nyuaj kom deb li deb.

